The BATNA/WATNA Agent (Best/Worst Alternative to Negotiated Agreement) helps parties and mediators assess their strategic position by simulating possible outcomes if no settlement is reached. It quantifies potential legal costs, timelines, and recovery values under litigation or liquidation scenarios.";}s:8:"relation";a:1:{s:10:"firstimage";s:0:"";}}s:10:"persistent";a:4:{s:4:"date";a:1:{s:7:"created";i:1761648648;}s:7:"creator";s:11:"Atul Grover";s:4:"user";s:5:"admin";s:11:"last_change";a:9:{s:4:"date";i:1761648648;s:2:"ip";s:13:"49.43.109.130";s:4:"type";s:1:"C";s:2:"id";s:71:"digital_agents:mediation_agents:hearing_facilitations:batna_watna_agent";s:4:"user";s:5:"admin";s:3:"sum";s:7:"created";s:5:"extra";s:0:"";s:10:"sizechange";i:779;s:4:"mode";s:4:"page";}}}